// README.md
# TicketSync Frontend (Cognito Integration)

React-based frontend with AWS Cognito authentication.

## Features
- User registration and login via AWS Cognito
- JWT token storage and session management
- Secure dashboard with logout functionality

## Setup
1. Replace values in `src/aws-exports.js` with your Cognito credentials.
2. Run:
```bash
npm install
npm start
